       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "School:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " adaptation to school, school problems (behavior or learning issues), school performance and progress, school attendance, Individualized Education Plan or special education services, involvement in school activities and after-school programs."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
